  "description": "CPU-only Named Entity Recognition (NER) PII detection plugin for SecureRedact (.NET 8 & 10). Detects and masks person names, street addresses, and organizations in English, Hinglish, and Hindi Devanagari using sub-millisecond Aho-Corasick contextual NER plus quantized ONNX DistilBERT/BERT transformers with pure-.NET model download, CPU usage limits, and zero GPU or Python dependency.",
